    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061114.0305\n\nBERLIN, Nov. 14 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nGerman stocks close lower\n\n\n\n\nGerman stocks ended lower on Tuesday on the Frankfurt market.\n\nThe 30-share DAX Index lost 6.35 percent to 6,387.38 points.\n\nThe MDAX index of medium-sized companies was down 0.21 percent to 8,877.6 points.\n\nThe TecDAX index of technologies and science firms lost 0.65 percent to 706.71.",
